📌 Project Overview

This project showcases an interactive Power BI dashboard developed to analyze Blinkit's retail sales performance, customer purchasing behavior, outlet characteristics, and product trends.

The dashboard transforms raw sales data into actionable business insights, enabling stakeholders to monitor KPIs, identify growth opportunities, and make data-driven decisions.

🎯 Business Problem

Retail businesses generate large volumes of transactional data, but extracting meaningful insights can be challenging.

This dashboard was designed to answer key business questions:

Which outlet types generate the highest revenue?
Which product categories contribute most to sales?
How do outlet size and location impact performance?
What are customer preferences regarding product fat content?
How have outlet sales evolved over time?
🛠️ Tech Stack
