📈 Dashboard Features
1️⃣ Sales Performance Overview

Provides a high-level view of business performance through KPI cards.

Metrics Monitored
Total Revenue
Total Products Sold
Average Sales Value
Customer Rating
Business Value

Allows management to quickly evaluate overall performance.

2️⃣ Outlet Establishment Trend

Analyzes sales performance based on outlet establishment year.

Insights
Revenue remains relatively stable across years.
A significant dip is observed around 2011.
Sales recover and stabilize in later years.
Business Value

Helps identify the impact of outlet age on sales performance.

3️⃣ Fat Content Analysis

Compares sales contribution from:

Regular Fat Products
Low Fat Products
Insights
Regular-fat products account for approximately 65% of sales.
Low-fat products contribute around 35%.
Business Value

Supports inventory and product assortment decisions.

