📋 Data Cleaning & Preparation

The following preprocessing steps were performed:

Data Quality Checks
Removed duplicate records
Handled missing values
Standardized category names
Corrected data types
Data Transformation
Created calculated columns
Built data model relationships
Designed DAX measures
Optimized dashboard performance
🧮 DAX Measures Used
Total Sales
Total Sales = SUM(BlinkIT[Sales])
Average Sales
Average Sales = AVERAGE(BlinkIT[Sales])
Total Items
Total Items = COUNT(BlinkIT[Item Identifier])
Average Rating
Average Rating = AVERAGE(BlinkIT[Rating])
🔍 Business Insights
Revenue Insights
Total revenue crossed ₹1.2 Million.
Supermarket Type 1 contributes the largest share of sales.
Tier 3 outlets outperform Tier 1 and Tier 2 locations.
Customer Insights
Average customer rating remains consistently high at 4.0.
Customers show a stronger preference for regular-fat products.
Operational Insights
Medium-sized outlets achieve the best overall performance.
Household and Dairy categories are major revenue drivers.
Strategic Recommendations
Expand operations in Tier 3 markets.
Increase inventory for high-performing product categories.
Focus marketing efforts on medium-sized outlets.
Improve visibility for underperforming categories.
📈 Business Impact

This dashboard enables decision-makers to:

✅ Monitor sales performance in real time

✅ Identify profitable outlet formats

✅ Understand customer purchasing behavior

✅ Optimize product inventory

✅ Support data-driven expansion strategies

